* Primary Input Signal Sources (8 Ports)
* PI: op_code
V_op n_29 0 pulse(0 2m 10.0p 2p 2p 2p 40.0p)
* PI: a
V_a n_13 0 pulse(0 2m 10.0p 2p 2p 2p 40.0p)
* PI: b
V_b n_14 0 pulse(0 2m 10.0p 2p 2p 2p 40.0p)

* Connect internal gate inputs
